('Cloud Computing & DevOps','6.824 Distributed Computer Systems Engineering — Massachusetts Institute of Technology','MIT''s graduate distributed systems course — the foundation of cloud infrastructure — covering RPC, crash recovery, cache consistency, two-phase commit, and Paxos through research papers, with lecture notes, programming labs (building a cluster file system), exams, and a final project.'),
